<title>THAILAND: PTTEP allows unit to invest in Burma gasfield.</title>
<headline>PTTEP allows unit to invest in Burma gasfield.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PTT Exploration and Production Plc said on Wednesday that it had allowed a unit of the company to invest in an offshore gas field in Burma's Gulf of Moattama.</p>
</text>
